<title>CANADA: Canadian oilseeds weekly crushing data - Dec 20.</title>
<headline>Canadian oilseeds weekly crushing data - Dec 20.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Oilseed Processors Association weekly summary of member crushing, in tonnes - WEEK ENDING	  CANOLA    SOYBEANS</p>
<p>December 18	  44,109    30,129</p>
<p>change prv week   +10.3 pct  -4.5 pct</p>
<p>December 11	  39,991    31,544</p>
<p>December 6	   54,110    30,185</p>
<p>November 27	  54,064    30,994</p>
<p>Aug 1 to date   1,086,677   496,248</p>
<p>-- Note: COPA consists of Archer Daniels Midland Co ,  CanAmera Foods, Canbra Foods Ltd and Northern Lite Canola Inc with crush data also provided by Cargill Ltd, Canadian unit of Minnesota-based Cargill Inc.</p>
<p>(Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548)</p>
